#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "KFind can be used as a standalone search tool, launched by KRunner or "
#| "from your menu. It is also integrated into Konqueror and Dolphin as "
#| "\"Find File\" in the \"Tools\" menu. It allows you to find files by name, "
#| "type or content."
msgid ""
"KFind can be used as a standalone search tool, launched by KRunner or from "
"your menu. It is also integrated into Konqueror as \"Find File\" in the "
"\"Tools\" menu. It allows you to find files by name, type or content."
msgstr ""
"KFind lett sik för sik as Söökwarktüüch bruken un vun KRunner oder över't "
"Menü opropen. Dat arbeidt ok binnen Konqueror un Dolphin, binnen dat "
"Warktüüch-Menü is dat de Punkt „Datei söken“. Du kannst dor mit na "
"Dateinaams, -typ un -inholt söken."
